/target
.scratch/

# Agent scratch, not project configuration. `.claude/` itself is not ignored:
# a committed `settings.json`, `agents/` or `commands/` belongs to the repo and
# should stay reviewable. These two do not — `worktrees/` holds throwaway git
# worktrees an agent checks out and deletes, and `settings.local.json` is one
# machine's overrides by the `.local` convention.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
